WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.684 --> 00:00:04.870
Put in the effort!

00:00:05.916 --> 00:00:07.440
If you want to make it as an entrepreneur

00:00:07.559 --> 00:00:09.274
you got to put in the effort.

00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:10.276
You need to work for it.

00:00:10.437 --> 00:00:11.200
It’s not going to be easy.

00:00:11.896 --> 00:00:13.385
You’re putting your blood, your sweat

00:00:13.545 --> 00:00:14.581
your tears, everything you got

00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:16.417
into making this business fly.

00:00:17.205 --> 00:00:18.294
I recently posted a tweet

00:00:19.324 --> 00:00:20.443
with a quote from Mark Cuban

00:00:20.443 --> 00:00:22.063
and Mark Cuban is a hustler.

00:00:22.616 --> 00:00:25.377
The guy works hard and his quote was that I shared

00:00:25.684 --> 00:00:29.464
“There’s very little knowledge that can’t be obtained through effort.”

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:34.516
And I got a tweet back from Kingston4Live

00:00:35.225 --> 00:00:37.339
who wrote, “Can you explain that to me.”

00:00:37.969 --> 00:00:38.537
Here’s the thing.

00:00:39.423 --> 00:00:42.285
As entrepreneurs a lot of us have limiting personal beliefs.

00:00:42.557 --> 00:00:44.412
We think, “Because I don’t know this

00:00:45.184 --> 00:00:46.349
I’m not going to have success.”

00:00:47.906 --> 00:00:51.358
And Cuban’s point is whatever you don’t know

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.659
whatever you need to find out

00:00:53.276 --> 00:00:55.359
if you are willing to put in the time and the effort

00:00:56.138 --> 00:00:57.638
you can find an answer.

00:00:58.169 --> 00:01:00.089
If you really want to get in to an industry

00:01:00.364 --> 00:01:03.023
and you have no background in it, you can go in

00:01:03.223 --> 00:01:06.075
you can have massive success but you got to work for it.

00:01:06.774 --> 00:01:07.532
Anything you need to learn

00:01:07.786 --> 00:01:09.709
you can learn if you put in the time

00:01:09.905 --> 00:01:11.127
the effort, the patience

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:13.760
the hustle to figure out how to make it work.

00:01:15.586 --> 00:01:16.507
So that’s his point.

00:01:16.749 --> 00:01:18.236
You’re not going to have massive success

00:01:18.428 --> 00:01:19.737
as a startup working 40 hours a week.

00:01:20.785 --> 00:01:23.123
If you look at Cuban and how he got started

00:01:23.353 --> 00:01:26.352
he had huge success in everything that he touched at the beginning

00:01:26.788 --> 00:01:28.579
because he was the hardest working guy.

00:01:29.371 --> 00:01:31.227
When he was starting off as an employee

00:01:31.645 --> 00:01:33.132
he was still the hardest working employee.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.652
When he started with his various businesses

00:01:34.829 --> 00:01:37.476
he worked it harder than any of his competition.

00:01:38.206 --> 00:01:40.109
Even though he had less knowledge getting into it

00:01:40.902 --> 00:01:43.378
he became the most knowledgeable person about that business

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:45.625
and people flocked to him because customers

00:01:45.827 --> 00:01:46.817
want to deal with experts

00:01:47.754 --> 00:01:50.301
and he only got that knowledge because he put in the time

00:01:50.771 --> 00:01:52.294
he put in the effort, he hustled

00:01:52.533 --> 00:01:54.425
he needed to make this happen.

00:01:55.518 --> 00:01:56.840
So you got to do the same with your business.

00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:00.268
You have to commit to it

00:02:01.864 --> 00:02:03.073
You’ve got to pour yourself into it.

00:02:03.332 --> 00:02:04.735
You have to believe that what you’re doing is right

00:02:06.464 --> 00:02:07.319
that it’s going to work out.

00:02:08.818 --> 00:02:10.372
If you put enough heart, passion

00:02:10.612 --> 00:02:13.307
energy, and effort into making it happen.

00:02:14.195 --> 00:02:15.664
And it’s okay even if you’re starting part time

00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:19.148
but do something every day to grow this thing, right?

00:02:19.148 --> 00:02:21.495
The goal is that you don’t have to be a part time entrepreneur.

00:02:22.932 --> 00:02:24.607
You can quit your job and do this full time

00:02:24.607 --> 00:02:26.317
and make a huge income and have a huge impact

00:02:27.758 --> 00:02:30.515
but it comes from doing something every single day

00:02:31.649 --> 00:02:33.135
to move your business forward

00:02:33.636 --> 00:02:34.571
even if it’s just a little bit

00:02:35.364 --> 00:02:36.864
because as soon as you start giving up on that

00:02:37.169 --> 00:02:38.721
as soon as you stop putting in the effort

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:39.917
your company dies.

00:02:40.948 --> 00:02:42.417
You have to be the heartbeat of the business.

00:02:43.239 --> 00:02:44.176
You’ve got to pour into it

00:02:45.336 --> 00:02:46.129
put your full energy

00:02:46.304 --> 00:02:47.368
put your full effort

00:02:48.298 --> 00:02:48.932
love it

00:02:50.272 --> 00:02:52.257
and you will have success with your company.

00:02:53.591 --> 00:02:54.366
Believe.

00:02:55.185 --> 00:02:57.199
I hope that helps shed a little light on that quote.

00:02:57.424 --> 00:02:59.819
I love it and hopefully it inspires you guys too.

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:02.537
If you guys liked the video, thumbs-up below.

00:03:03.004 --> 00:03:03.840
Love seeing those come in.

00:03:04.161 --> 00:03:05.471
And I want to hear what you have to think.

00:03:05.471 --> 00:03:06.406
Please leave a comment underneath.

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.088
I want to know what you’re thinking

00:03:08.264 --> 00:03:08.816
you like the video

00:03:09.058 --> 00:03:11.007
you have a question for you company let me know.

00:03:11.216 --> 00:03:12.944
I’ll do a video response. Thank you guys

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:13.899
we’ll see you soon.

